    <statement><p>The displacement (in meters) of a particle moving in a straight line
is given by <m>s = 2 t^3</m> where <m>t</m> is measured in seconds.</p>
<p>Find the average velocity of the particle over the time interval
<m>[ 10 , 13]</m>.
<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Find the (instantaneous) velocity of the particle when <m>t = 10</m>.
<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{2\cdot \left(13^{3}-10^{3}\right)}{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>3\cdot 2\cdot 10\cdot 10</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
